OL,3,ATravel disrupted and events cancelled
OL,4,Aas Storm Boelo hits UK with wind and
OL,5,Arain
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, a marathon in the Eryri
OL,8,Fnational park in north Wales was called
OL,9,Foff, as well as a range of events in
OL,10,FEngland, Scotland, and Northern Ireland
OL,12,FThe Met Office has issued six weather
OL,13,Fwarnings covering much of the UK
OL,14,Fbetween Saturday and Sunday - three are
OL,15,Falready in effect
OL,17,FAmber warnings for wind in northern
OL,18,FEngland, Scotland, and parts of
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland begin at 21:00
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
