OL,3,AArrest made after fire at Hitler's
OL,4,Amountaintop Eagle's Nest retreat
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in the southern German state of
OL,7,FBavaria have detained a 33-year-old
OL,8,FGerman man during a fire at Adolf
OL,9,FHitler's Alpine mountain retreat, the
OL,10,FKehlsteinhaus, also known as the
OL,11,FEagle's Nest.
OL,13,FDispatchers in Traunstein received a
OL,14,Ffire alarm from the building at 21:15
OL,15,Flocal time (19:15 GMT) on Friday and
OL,16,Ffirefighters found it engulfed in
OL,17,Fflames. No injuries were reported,
OL,18,Fwhile difficult terrain hindered
OL,19,Fefforts to extinguish the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
