OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AArrest made after fire at Hitler's
OL,4,Amountaintop Eagle's Nest retreat
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said they apprehended the
OL,7,Fsuspect riding a motorcycle near the
OL,8,Fscene and told reporters that any
OL,9,Fpossible motive was still being
OL,10,Fexamined.
OL,12,FSome 200 emergency personnel were
OL,13,Fdeployed and a criminal investigation
OL,14,Fhas been launched.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
