CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1792853292
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFather who killed Oregon school gunman
OL,4,Adescribes anguish over children he
OL,5,Acouldn't save
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I want to apologise for not saving
OL,8,Ftheir babies," Giamanco, who has been
OL,9,Fhailed as a hero, said of his thoughts
OL,10,Ffor the parents of the children killed,
OL,11,Fin an interview with Oregon Public
OL,12,FBroadcasting (OPB) that aired on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,F"The gratitude for saving people's
OL,16,Fchildren is awesome, but there were
OL,17,Fones that I didn't save."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
